-individual:Gated sphn-individual:PostbiopsyPlus sphn-individual:3DRendering sphn-individual:Resampled sphn-individual:FlowEncoded sphn-individual:Tomosynthesis sphn-individual:DiffusionMap sphn-individual:Subtraction sphn-individual:PhaseMap sphn-individual:Postmarker sphn-individual:Cine sphn-individual:RetinalThick sphn-individual:Generated2D sphn-individual:Obstetrical sphn-individual:ASL sphn-individual:Postbiopsy sphn-individual:MatRemoved sphn-individual:Portal sphn-individual:Prefire ) ;
            sh:path [ sh:inversePath rdf:type ] ] ;
    sh:targetClass sphn:ImagingFrame_type .

